~ intro
set Gamemanager.dialogue_is_active = true 
Adeline [Happy]: We should participate !! That ten quadrillion dollars might get us out of this shack..
Sam [Thinking]: Let’s practice before competing in a competition..
Sam [Thinking]: It’s been a while since we’ve actually done any music.
Lyre [Excited]: ur rite we should totes do that now ! 
Veronica [Awkward]: How are we going to practice without instruments
Veronica [Sparkle]: oh nevermind..  they're right there
set Gamemanager.dialogue_is_active = true 
set Gamemanager.begin_end = true
=> END


~ start
#set Gamemanager.intro= true
set Gamemanager.dialogue_is_active = true 
Lyre [Awkward]: Okay guys, we're here. Lets do our best and win this competition!
Adeline [Happy]: Yeah! Break a leg!
Veronica [Happy]: We're gonna wipe the competion and be the best!
Sam [Neutral]: Oh look! I think were up!
set Gamemanager.dialogue_is_active = false 
set Gamemanager.first_round_intro = true
=> END

~ after
set Gamemanager.dialogue_is_active = true 
Lyre [Excited]: I think we did pretty good! The crowd loved us!
Sam [Neutral]: It was our first time infront of a crowd, but i think we did pretty well!
Blue Hotdog [1]: Ha ha ha go home you little ametures, This is no place for you guys.
Yellow Hotdog [1]: Did you actually hear youselves, yall SUCK.
Lyre [Hurt]: Who even are you people?
Blue Hotdog [1]: WE are the RYB hot dog people!
Yellow Hotdog [1]: Usally we're a quad but our big boss isn't here.
Blue Hotdog [1]: Yeah haha we're going to beat you regardless
Lyre [Stare]: ...
Lyre [Stare]: I'm going to rip your throat out. 
set Gamemanager.first_round_middle_fight = true
set Gamemanager.dialogue_is_active = false 
=> END

~ ending
set Gamemanager.dialogue_is_active = true 
Blue Hotdog [1]: You win kid... Fair and square...
Veronica [Awkward]: Dude. I think you just killed that guy.
Adeline [Hurt]: Oh... Oh My God. W-What the heck are we going to do?!?! 
Lyre [Awkward]: Lets get out of here!
Sam [Annoyed]: WHAT? ARE YOU CRAZY?
Lyre [Hurt]: Well YOU can stay behind and get arrested. I'm not!
set Gamemanager.dialogue_is_active = false 
=> END
